From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Victor Momplet <mompletvictor@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 14:07:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(food): Food tab in the bottom bar, Today card and energy
 balance
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Bottom bar: Today · Trends · Sleep · Food · Coach · More. The slot is added
  by withVictorTabs() at the bar's single binding, so upstream's tab lists and
  their iOS-parity tests stay untouched; Food leaves the More sheet (a bar tab
  must not also be a drawer row).
- Today: a Food card (intake, macros, balance, "Add a meal" into the Food tab)
  anchored above Workouts on today, without a new TodaySection (upstream's
  section tests pin the exact list).
- FoodEnergy: one resolver for energy out (activity like the Today Calories
  card + the phone's basal, else the scale BMR prorated for today) shared by
  the Food tab and the Today card via FoodDayCard, so both show the same
  balance. No balance is shown when the resting half is unknown.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
